  "title": "The Intimidating Wookiee, Krrsantan",
  "description": "Skulking out from the rear of the litter comes the deadly Wookiee gladiator turned bounty hunter named Krrsantan. Boba Fett instantly recognizes the Wookiee as he mockingly recites Krrsantan's tale, still holding his claim. As the Twins threaten to kill Fett, hands tighten on blasters all around, and Boba goads them even further. After a brief discussion, the Twins back down and offer the explanation that bloodshed is bad for business, but give Fett the simple advice: \"Sleep lightly.\""
